    <h2 style="font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Discover Interactive Fun and Random Tools</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">Sometimes you just need to leave a decision up to pure chance. Our collection helps you quickly pick a random name or roll virtual dice for tabletop gaming. We offer a highly customizable wheel of names that acts as a perfect random name picker for giveaways. Tabletop fans often use our dungeons and dragons dice roller to simulate authentic D4 to D20 rolls. You can easily switch between basic coin flips and complex RPG setups.</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">Writers and gamers love our random username name generator to build character portfolios quickly. We even built a complete morse alphabet translator. This translates normal text into authentic audio morse code signals. You might also want to check out our <a href="/dev/" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">Developer</a> utilities if you need to create random UUIDs or format complex data payloads.</p>
